  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Circular Economy Practices in Animal Feed Value Chain in Myanmar (Sein-Lan Myanmar)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to reduce the environmental degradation caused by Myanmar&apos;s animal feed sector and simultaneously enhanced economic returns throughout a more sustainable value chain. The specific objective targets the smallholders and MSMEs actively to get involved in animal feed production, distribution, and utilization adopt and benefit from the adoption of circular economy principles and practices.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
